        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left shoulder pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Gradually increased over approximately 3–4 weeks; baseline pain approximately 3–4/10, rising to 7/10 with overhead activity. Worse with overhead activity and reaching behind the back; pain at night when lying on the left side wakes the patient a few times per week."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left shoulder functional limitation"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Difficulty hanging washing and performing some client transfers; still working full time and swapping heavier tasks with colleagues."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left shoulder swelling or fullness"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports the shoulder looks a bit puffy and rounded compared with the right. Exam: no obvious deformity; possibly very slight anterolateral fullness on the left compared with the right."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
